spec PushDeadline.tla
check INVARIANTS TypeOK DeadlineUnlocks LateCannotChange WriteAfterPreflight FailurePreservesPlan UnconfirmedWriteNeedsLookup PermissionTimeoutDistinct UnconfirmedWriteSurvivesFailedLookup
check PROPERTIES AttemptReturns
reach PermissionTimedOut | one attempt
reach DeviceTimedOut | one attempt
reach LookupTimedOut | one attempt
reach WriteTimedOut | one attempt
reach RetryHasLateReply | two attempts
reach LookupAfterUnknownWrite | two attempts
reach FailedWithKnownPlan | two attempts
reach FailedLookupAfterUnknownWrite | two attempts
run one attempt | Limit=1
run two attempts | Limit=2
